Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.87,S,,0,0,0,,Sono le sette.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.87,0:00:02.55,S,,0,0,0,,Hai appena finito la notte.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.55,0:00:03.23,S,,0,0,0,,Sei stanca.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.23,0:00:06.15,S,,0,0,0,,E qualcuno ti chiede di fermarti ancora un'ora.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.45,0:00:06.85,S,,0,0,0,,Lo so.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.85,0:00:08.37,S,,0,0,0,,Te lo chiedo lo stesso.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.37,0:00:10.22,S,,0,0,0,,Sono Achille, della CISL FP.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.22,0:00:13.78,S,,0,0,0,,Lunedì sette dicembre, in Aula Magna, ti racconto come
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.78,0:00:15.30,S,,0,0,0,,stanno davvero le cose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:17.85,S,,0,0,0,,Il nuovo contratto e gli arretrati.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.85,0:00:20.18,S,,0,0,0,,I trecentocinquanta euro di welfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.18,0:00:23.08,S,,0,0,0,,Le notti, i turni da dodici ore, la pensione.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.08,0:00:25.21,S,,0,0,0,,Cosa ti spetta, e come ottenerlo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.51,0:00:26.29,S,,0,0,0,,Ma attenzione:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.29,0:00:29.50,S,,0,0,0,,ogni mese che passa un credito può scadere, e con la nuova
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:32.39,S,,0,0,0,,legge anche le ferie non fatte possono andare perse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.39,0:00:33.38,S,,0,0,0,,Chi non sa, perde.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.68,0:00:35.75,S,,0,0,0,,Non ti chiedo di credermi sulla parola.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.75,0:00:38.87,S,,0,0,0,,Ti porto i documenti originali, sullo schermo, uno per uno.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.87,0:00:39.72,S,,0,0,0,,Una sola verità:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.72,0:00:41.20,S,,0,0,0,,quella che puoi controllare.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:42.97,S,,0,0,0,,Dalle sette e mezza all'una.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.97,0:00:46.01,S,,0,0,0,,Puoi venire anche solo per un'ora, tra un turno e l'altro:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.01,0:00:47.47,S,,0,0,0,,ogni punto si regge da solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.77,0:00:48.80,S,,0,0,0,,E porta un collega.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.80,0:00:49.28,S,,0,0,0,,Uno solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.28,0:00:51.65,S,,0,0,0,,Quello che in pausa caffè si lamenta sempre:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.65,0:00:53.32,S,,0,0,0,,è proprio lui che deve sentire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.62,0:00:56.96,S,,0,0,0,,Lunedì sette dicembre, Aula Magna, secondo piano della
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.96,0:00:58.32,S,,0,0,0,,palazzina dei servizi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.32,0:00:59.62,S,,0,0,0,,Scrivimi su WhatsApp:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.62,0:01:00.12,S,,0,0,0,,ci sono.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.12,0:01:00.80,S,,0,0,0,,Io ci sarò.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.80,0:01:01.11,S,,0,0,0,,E tu?
